0,"Create a Python function that generates a random password of a given length, including uppercase, lowercase, digits, and special characters. Specify minimum occurrences for each character type.",377,,"[""```python
import string
import random

def generate_password(length=8):
    char_pool = string.ascii_letters + string.digits + string.punctuation
    password = [
        random.choice(string.ascii_uppercase) for _ in range(2 if length <= 4 else 3)
    ] + [
        random.choice(string.ascii_lowercase) for _ in range(length - len(password))
    ] + [
        random.choice(char_pool - string.ascii_letters - string.digits) for _ in range(1 if length <= 4 else 2)
    ] + [
        random.choice(string.digits) for _ in range(length // 4 if length % 4 != 0 else (length // 4) + 1)
    ]
    random.shuffle(password)
    return ''.join(password)
```

This function generates a password of the specified length, where at least two uppercase letters, two lowercase letters, and one special character or digit are included if the length is greater than 4

